const dirNames={NW:'좌상',N:'위',NE:'우상',W:'왼쪽',E:'오른쪽',SW:'좌하',S:'아래',SE:'우하'},spriteCache={},spriteErrors={},retouchedCache={};let spriteDir='SW',trailData={};
const angles={N:Math.PI/2,S:-Math.PI/2,E:Math.PI,W:0,NW:Math.PI/4,NE:Math.PI*.75,SW:-Math.PI/4,SE:-Math.PI*.75};
for(const d of ['NW','N','NE','W','center','E','SW','S','SE']){if(d==='center'){const s=document.createElement('span');s.className='center';s.textContent='방향';$('#directions').append(s);continue}const b=document.createElement('button');b.textContent=dirNames[d];b.dataset.dir=d;b.onclick=()=>{spriteDir=d;$('#camera').value=d;az=angles[d];el=.48;pan=[0,0];syncSprites()};$('#directions').append(b)}
function syncSprites(){for(const b of $('#directions').querySelectorAll('button')){b.disabled=unit!=='soldier'&&b.dataset.dir!=='SW'&&viewMode!=='3d';b.classList.toggle('active',b.dataset.dir===spriteDir);b.setAttribute('aria-pressed',b.dataset.dir===spriteDir)}frame=Math.min(frame,count()-1);$('#frame').max=count()-1;$('#overview').disabled=viewMode==='3d'||unit!=='soldier';$('#compare').disabled=viewMode!=='sprite'||unit!=='soldier';if(viewMode!=='sprite')$('#compare').checked=false;$('#status').hidden=viewMode!=='3d'||frames.length>0;$('.help').textContent=viewMode!=='3d'?'방향·동작 선택 · 휠/두 손가락: 확대':'드래그: 회전 · Shift/오른쪽 드래그: 이동 · 휠: 확대';update()}
$('#mode').onchange=e=>{viewMode=e.target.value;az=angles[spriteDir];el=.48;zoom=1;pan=[0,0];syncSprites()};$('#overview').onchange=()=>{if($('#overview').checked)$('#compare').checked=false;dirty=true};$('#compare').onchange=()=>{if($('#compare').checked)$('#overview').checked=false;dirty=true};$('#camera').onchange=e=>{preset(e.target.value);if(angles[e.target.value]!==undefined)spriteDir=e.target.value;syncSprites()};
// Direct 16-column render atlas, with real alpha. Never reconstruct or alter poses.
for(const d of Object.keys(dirNames)){const im=new Image();im.onload=()=>{spriteCache[d]=im;dirty=true};im.onerror=()=>{spriteErrors[d]=true;dirty=true};im.src=`sprites/${d}.png?v=motion9`}
fetch('trails.json').then(r=>r.json()).then(d=>{trailData=d;dirty=true}).catch(()=>{});
function modelCell(cx,cy,size,d){if(!frames.length)return;const a=angles[d],t=[Math.cos(a)*Math.cos(.48),Math.sin(a)*Math.cos(.48),Math.sin(.48)],r=[-Math.sin(a),Math.cos(a),0],u=cross(t,r),s=size*34.6/128;const project=p=>{p=sub(p,[0,0,1]);return[cx+dot(p,r)*s,cy+size*.01-dot(p,u)*s]};const fs=frames[action*16+frame].slice();if(action===2)for(const v of trailData[frame]||[])fs.push({v,center:[0,1,2].map(i=>v.reduce((s,p)=>s+p[i],0)/v.length),color:'rgba(147,188,248,.49)'});fs.sort((a,b)=>dot(a.center,t)-dot(b.center,t));for(const f of fs){ctx.beginPath();f.v.forEach((v,i)=>i?ctx.lineTo(...project(v)):ctx.moveTo(...project(v)));ctx.closePath();ctx.fillStyle=f.color;ctx.fill()}}
window.renderSprites=function(){const w=canvas.clientWidth,h=canvas.clientHeight,dpr=Math.min(devicePixelRatio,2);if(canvas.width!==Math.round(w*dpr)||canvas.height!==Math.round(h*dpr)){canvas.width=Math.round(w*dpr);canvas.height=Math.round(h*dpr)}ctx.setTransform(dpr,0,0,dpr,0,0);ctx.clearRect(0,0,w,h);ctx.imageSmoothingEnabled=false;const all=$('#overview').checked,compare=$('#compare').checked&&!all;const dirs=all?['NW','N','NE','W',null,'E','SW','S','SE']:compare?[spriteDir,spriteDir]:[spriteDir];const vertical=compare&&w<500,cols=all?3:compare&&!vertical?2:1,rows=all?3:vertical?2:1;dirs.forEach((d,i)=>{if(!d)return;const cw=w/cols,ch=h/rows,cx=(i%cols+.5)*cw,cy=(Math.floor(i/cols)+.5)*ch,size=Math.min(cw,ch)*.92*zoom,im=(unit!=='soldier'?unitImages[unit]:(viewMode==='retouched'?retouchedCache:spriteCache)[d]);ctx.fillStyle='#bccce0';ctx.font='14px system-ui';ctx.textAlign='center';ctx.fillText((compare?(i===0?'픽셀 음영':'3D 원본')+' · ':'')+dirNames[d],cx,cy+ch*.44);if(compare&&i===1){modelCell(cx,cy,size,d);return}if(im){const sw=viewMode==='retouched'?im.naturalWidth/4:128,sh=viewMode==='retouched'?im.naturalHeight/5:128;ctx.drawImage(im,frame*sw,action*sh,sw,sh,cx-size/2,cy-size/2,size,size)}else{ctx.fillText(spriteErrors[d]?'불러오기 실패':'불러오는 중…',cx,cy)}});$('#badge').textContent=`${all?'8방향':dirNames[spriteDir]} · ${names[action]} · ${frame+1} / ${count()}`;};syncSprites();

for(const d of Object.keys(dirNames)){const im=new Image();im.onload=()=>{retouchedCache[d]=im;dirty=true};im.onerror=()=>{spriteErrors[d]=true;dirty=true};im.src=`retouched/${d}.webp?v=motion9`;}
